            .org $D000
S8E00 .equ Stage8MainFailPoint-Stage8MainFailSource
S8E01 .equ Stage8InfallibleFailPoint-Stage8InfallibleFailSource
S8E02 .equ Stage8FailureRangePoint+5-Stage8FailureRangeSource
S8E03 .equ Stage8FailureFlowPoint-1-Stage8FailureFlowSource
S8E04 .equ Stage8PropagationFailurePoint-Stage8PropagationFailureSource
S8E05 .equ Stage8ReadInputNestedServicePoint-Stage8ReadInputSuccessSource
S8E06 .equ Stage8IncompleteForwardSourceEnd-Stage8IncompleteForwardSource
S8E07 .equ Stage8PredefinedVariablePoint-Stage8PredefinedVariableSource
S8E08 .equ Stage8PredefinedRoutinePoint-Stage8PredefinedRoutineSource
S8E09 .equ Stage8PredefinedParameterPoint-Stage8PredefinedParameterSource
S8E0A .equ Stage8WriteStorageTypePoint+4-Stage8WriteStorageTypeSource
S8E0B .equ Stage8SeekStorageTypePoint+4-Stage8SeekStorageTypeSource
